    - isotropic matrix contribution;
    - anisotropic fiber contribution;
    - nearly incompressible treatment.

Required implementation information:
    Constitutive equations.
    Material parameters.
    Units.
    Parameter-to-variable mapping.
    COMSOL implementation syntax.

Current status:
    DOCUMENTED / EXECUTION ARTIFACT PENDING.


L8 — BOUNDARY CONDITIONS
-----------------------
Artifact:
    Patient-specific mechanical boundary-condition implementation.

Documented specification:
    Anatomically defined basal mechanical constraint intended to prevent
    nonphysical rigid-body motion while allowing physiological deformation.

